    "notes": "Case design corrected after the first live run: this model consistently (3/3 repeat calls) pairs a plain metric+number phrasing with its closest matching concept, not just the bare filter. This is not a defect -- IntentResolver's override rule already handles 'concept + explicit number on the same metric' correctly, replacing the concept's own threshold with the user's number rather than ANDing both (see IntentResolverTests). The original expectation (filter only, no concept) was narrower than what \u00a75.1 actually requires."
